# Layout for Pinball 2000's 640x480 CRT (Revenge From Mars, Star Wars Episode I)

Width: 640
Height: 480
Fit: Contain

Visuals:
	- Screen:
		Rect: [0,0,640,480]
		Style: CRT
		Size: [640, 480]
		Glass:
			Roughness: 0.1
			Image:     ./Glass-Dirty-1.webp
			Area:      [192,16,640,480]
			Ambient:   [0.2,0.2,0.2]
